---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<figure class="lab-preview">
  <figcaption>
    <Icon name="flask" />
    <strong>From report to proposed results</strong>
  </figcaption>
  <div class="report-source">
    <Icon name="document" />
    <div>
      <strong>External lab report</strong>
      <small>PDF or image attached to an analysis request</small>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="extraction-join" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="proposed-results">
    <div class="result-heading">
      <strong>Results for review</strong>
      <span class="pill">AI suggestions</span>
    </div>
    <div class="proposed-row">
      <span>Moisture</span>
      <strong>4.2%</strong>
      <span class="pill green">Matched</span>
    </div>
    <div class="proposed-row">
      <span>Yeasts & moulds</span>
      <strong>&lt; 10 cfu/g</strong>
      <span class="pill amber">Check reading</span>
    </div>
    <details>
      <summary>What happens with an uncertain result?</summary>
      <p>
        The analyst checks the report, corrects the proposed result if needed,
        then accepts or dismisses the suggestion before saving.
      </p>
    </details>
    <p class="human-step">
      <Icon name="users" /> Review → accept or correct → save
    </p>
  </div>
  <p class="caption">Workflow illustration · fictional data</p>
</figure>
<style>
  .lab-preview {
    margin: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 28px;
  }
  figcaption {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 17px;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }
  figcaption strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .lab-preview :global(.icon) {
    color: var(--blue);
  }
  .report-source {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 17px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 5px;
  }
  .report-source strong {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .report-source small {
    display: block;
    color: var(--slate);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .extraction-join {
    width: 1px;
    height: 25px;
    background: var(--connector);
    margin: auto;
  }
  .proposed-results {
    background: var(--mist);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .result-heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .result-heading strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .proposed-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto auto;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 14px 0;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .proposed-row strong {
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  details {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 14px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--blue);
  }
  summary:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--focus);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }
  details p {
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .human-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .human-step :global(.icon) {
    width: 17px;
  }
  .caption {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .lab-preview {
      padding: 18px;
    }
    .proposed-results {
      padding: 15px;
    }
    .proposed-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    }
    .proposed-row .pill {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      justify-self: start;
    }
  }
</style>
